{"title":"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangle</a> bounded by the lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/4244fc7d77951177f718b58f2a8218548fc830c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x, y = - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"110\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/c/61ca7058f9c648d6f3566523b37634d3be9fda82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/8/da81e6653580484eaa2c2753bfa97ce7f50bd017.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ 12 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ 12\\sqrt{2} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ 24 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 24\\sqrt{2} } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ 36 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"436\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/6/6863401960a6ad7e98ced6f1e4b5c85e86470a46.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(fontsize(8)); draw((0,0)--(6,6)--(-6,6)--(0,0)); draw((0,-1)--(0,8)); draw((-7,0)--(7,0)); label(&quot;$(6,6)$&quot;,(6,6), (1,1));label(&quot;$(-6,6)$&quot;,(-6,6),(-1,1)); label(&quot;$y=x$&quot;,(3,3),(1,-1));label(&quot;$y=-x$&quot;,(-3,3),(-1,-0.5)); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(-3,6),(0,1));label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(3,6),(0,1)); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(0,3),(-1,0)); [/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"432\" /></center>\n<p>The height of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/c/61ca7058f9c648d6f3566523b37634d3be9fda82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, and the width of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/051143eb89ec73726432fa964c7d87d5f17733a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x_1| + |x_2| = 2y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" />. Thus the area of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/d/30d9b4b01e86b3871df46bbc77803f682e65d04d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 12 \\cdot 6 \\cdot 12 = 36\\ \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"139\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME\" title=\"1995 AHSME\">1995 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\"